## Key Protocols Observed

| Protocol | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| DNS | Resolves domain names into IP addresses |
| UDP | Transport protocol commonly used by DNS |
| IPv4 | Internet addressing protocol |
| IPv6 | Next-generation Internet addressing protocol |
